00:06:05.840 --> 00:06:07.840
Here you can see it automatically

00:06:07.840 --> 00:06:09.840
installing

00:06:09.840 --> 00:06:11.840
the optimised

00:06:11.840 --> 00:06:13.840
model

00:06:13.840 --> 00:06:15.840
