00:06:23.840 --> 00:06:25.840
We want everything to be local.

00:06:25.840 --> 00:06:27.840
And we want the very highest performance.

00:06:27.840 --> 00:06:29.840
Not necessarily the most options.

00:06:29.840 --> 00:06:31.840
